    "methodology": "One hundred scenario records were manually specified in advance, including operational narratives, omissions, adversarial strings, exact known values and oracle labels. A deterministic one-use authoring helper copied eight domain/taxonomy fixtures, seven operational SOP templates plus one unspecified template, fixed synthetic UUID namespaces, fixed timestamps, canonical staff scoring and exact source hashes into each complete JSON snapshot. Shared templates were expanded during authoring only. This committed JSON file is the complete dataset; the evaluation loader validates it and reads exact bytes without case generation, randomization or live retrieval. Hand-specified analysis isolates recommendation behavior. All live cases use TRIAGED because that is the sole state accepted by scheduling; rejected-state/currentness checks belong to the independent failure matrix. Pre-final oracle-only review added seven distinct forbidden literal probes to every case, including known-field substitutions, and exact UTC clock aliases for supplied ISO incident times. This correction does not alter any request/evidence/model input. The initial authoring assumption START_WORK-only when missingFields is empty was corrected after reviewing the owning Recommendation V2 prompt, which explicitly permits both START_WORK and REQUEST_USER_INFO at TRIAGED. This aligns the oracle with the existing product contract; deliberately missing required facts still require REQUEST_USER_INFO and RESOLVE is forbidden for all cases. The preflight preserves the initial dataset bytes and measured action variability. No product or model input changed."
